# Apple Music and Podcasts (🍎 苹果媒体).
# Loaded before apple.list so these names beat DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com.
# Default is DIRECT, so a China Apple ID keeps working. Point this group at a
# node only when the catalog should follow another storefront.
# TV+ and News are in apple-proxy.list. Mac process names Music / TV / Podcasts
# are omitted; they are generic words.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,music.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,podcasts.apple.com
DOMAIN,amp-api.media.apple.com
DOMAIN,audio.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,aod.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,aod-ssl.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,mvod.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,streamingaudio.itunes.apple.com

PROCESS-NAME,AppleMusic.exe
PROCESS-NAME,AMPLibraryAgent.exe
PROCESS-NAME,com.apple.android.music
